<title>UK: TABLE - Rubicon yr profits jump 31 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Rubicon yr profits jump 31 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to May 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr* (pence)		12.2		  vs  13.5</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	   4.1		  vs   n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)   6.3		  vs   6.0</p>
<p> Pretax			14.2		  vs  10.9</p>
<p> Turnover		   231.1		  vs 177.4</p>
<p>NOTE - *EPS adjusted to exclude exceptional items of 2.5 million stg incurred in cost reduction and restructuring programme. Unadjusted was 11.7 versus 13.3.</p>
<p>&quot;Against a background of generally volatile customer demand, and strong sterling, the current order book is much improved and we are cautiously optimistic about the group's prospects for 1997/98,&quot; said chairman David Carruthers.</p>
<p>Full name of engineering company - Rubicon Group Plc</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
